{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50163","headline":"奉使松府（伯三七七一。下同） · 胡皓","name":"奉使松府（伯三七七一。下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀山固地险，（项云「固」当作「匝」，形近而讹。\n）汉水接天平。\n波涛去东别[一]，林嶂隐西倾[二]。\n露白蓬根断，风秋草叶鸣。\n孤舟忽不见，垂泪坐盈盈。\n（[一]刘云：「东别谓大别也。\n《禹贡》汉水又区爲沧浪之水，至於大别。\n」[二]刘云：「西倾谓西倾山。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}